  "historyNote": "#8696, eff 7-29-06; ss by #10640, INTERIM, eff 7-29-14, EXPIRED: 1-26-15 New. #10783, eff 2-13-15 (from He-C 6355.26); ss by #14224, INTERIM, eff 3-29-25, EXPIRES: 9-25-25",
